# Architecture

## Components

### GitHub Trigger

Starts the workflow whenever a Pull Request event occurs.

### Edit Fields

Extracts:

- Repository
- Pull Request Number
- Repository Owner

### HTTP Request

Retrieves changed files using the GitHub REST API.

### IF Node

Filters source code files based on file extensions.

### Google Gemini

Performs AI-powered code review.

### GitHub Comment

Publishes the generated review back to the Pull Request.

---

